        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Good.\\. As he mentioned, some important tools abandoned with the mine are still lost inside of it.",
          "transl": "Gut!\\. Wie er erwähnte, liegen in der Mine immer noch einige wichtige Werkzeuge verschollen."
